**OVERALL: PASS (scope)** — emit and `chs_rt` **do not expand** first-class AST macros.
Residual refuse names are **`macro_expand`** and **`ast_macro`** (`AST_MACROS`), live at
**check / run / emit-wasm**. A macro-body SECRET second pass is **unneeded** on path A.

Do **not** greenwash: product `emit-c` / `emit-llvm` / `emit-bc` **skip** residual
refuse. Stmt-form becomes an **unresolved C/LLVM/BC call**, not an expander.
`macro_expand` is **not** a SECRETSINK. `oodac build` still dies at gcc.

